# Trae IDE rules for Video2Text
# Trae reads AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / .cursorrules / .clinerules / .windsurfrules.
# This file documents the precedence Trae should follow.

# Precedence (first match wins):
# 1. AGENTS.md          — universal guide (all agents)
# 2. CLAUDE.md          — Claude Code specific
# 3. .cursorrules       — Cursor / Trae specific
# 4. .clinerules        — Cline / Roo Code
# 5. .windsurfrules     — Windsurf

# Project
Video2Text — offline video transcription (Bilibili / Douyin / local files).
Python 3.8+, core lib `video2text/`, batch lib `douyin_batch/`.

# Conventions
- All user-visible strings via `t()` from `douyin_batch/i18n.py`.
- `pathlib.Path` everywhere.
- Run `python run_tests.py` after changes (38 tests).
- See AGENTS.md for full guide.
